# Privacy Policy

**Last updated: August 28, 2026**

This Privacy Policy explains how **Chetin** ("we," "our," or "us") handles information when you use our mobile game.

## 1. Information We Collect

Our game does not require users to create an account or provide personal information directly to us.

We do not use analytics services to track or analyze your activity in the game.

However, our game uses **Google AdMob** to display advertisements. AdMob may collect and process certain information automatically, such as device information, advertising identifiers, approximate location, and information related to advertising and app interactions, in accordance with Google's policies.

## 2. Advertising

We use Google AdMob to provide advertisements in our game.

Google and its advertising partners may use information collected through the app to provide, personalize, measure, and improve advertisements, subject to applicable laws and user choices.

For more information about how Google handles data, please review Google's privacy information and advertising policies.

## 3. Children's Privacy

Our game is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children.

If you are a parent or guardian and believe that a child has provided personal information through our game, please contact us so that we can take appropriate action.

## 4. Third-Party Services

Our game uses third-party services, including Google AdMob.

These third-party services may collect information according to their own privacy policies. We encourage you to review Google's privacy policy for more information about how AdMob handles information.

## 5. Data Security

We take reasonable steps to protect information associated with our game. However, no electronic transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

## 6. Data Retention

Chetin does not maintain user accounts or directly collect personal information for its own databases.

Information that may be collected by third-party advertising services is handled according to those services' respective policies.

## 7. Your Privacy Rights

Depending on where you live, you may have certain rights regarding your personal information, including rights to access, delete, restrict, or object to certain processing.

For information collected through Google AdMob, you may also have privacy and advertising choices provided by Google and your device or operating system.

## 8. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.

